sequenceDiagram
    actor Eng as Data Engineer
    participant PB as Pipeline Builder
    participant CE as Compute Engine (Spark/Flink/Polars)
    participant MI as Mimir (Mistral Small 3.2)
    participant OF as Object Fabric (Midgard)
    Eng->>PB: define pipeline (visual/low-code)
    PB->>MI: suggest transforms / infer schema
    MI-->>PB: typed transform suggestions
    PB->>CE: compile & execute (incremental)
    CE->>OF: write sealed datasets/objects
    OF-->>CE: commit + lineage
    CE-->>PB: build health + checks
    PB-->>Eng: preview + health report